# **5. Example Template (Non-Executable)**

```text
MEMORY_BRIDGE {
  STATE_DESCRIPTOR {
    intent: "retain reasoning frame"
    mode: "analysis"
    tone: "neutral"
    structural_preference: "layered"
  }

  REENTRY_RECONSTRUCTION {
    method: "rebuild_from_descriptor"
    semantic_tolerance: 0.2
  }

  CONTINUITY_LAYER {
    expectation: "respond as if continuity exists"
  }
}
```

The purpose is to **illustrate structure**,
not to provide a working mechanism.

